# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-08-03 11:17

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:13
translate italian lisa11_923fd11f:

    # "I lie in bed and slowly drift off to sleep."
    "Rimango a letto e scivolo lentamente nel sonno."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:14
translate italian lisa11_13cbfc43:

    # "Then I hear the door to my bedroom open."
    "Poi sento aprirsi la porta della mia camera da letto."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:18
translate italian lisa11_9c5bdb22:

    # sp "Honey?"
    sp "Tesoro?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:19
translate italian lisa11_08868f48:

    # "Lisa stands over me, looking at me nervously."
    "Lisa è in piedi davanti a me e mi guarda nervosamente."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:20
translate italian lisa11_9daec7e2:

    # pc "Hey, [mom]. Are you here to patch things up? I really want things to go back to the way they were."
    pc "Ehi, [mom]. Sei qui per fare pace? Vorrei davvero che le cose tornassero come prima."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:23
translate italian lisa11_b6018e7a:

    # "She sits on the bed and looks away, her eyes filled with sadness."
    "Si siede sul letto e distoglie lo sguardo, con gli occhi pieni di tristezza."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:24
translate italian lisa11_faf75111:

    # sp "No... um... I'm not ready to talk about that yet."
    sp "No... ehm... non sono ancora pronta a parlarne."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:25
translate italian lisa11_d690a0fb:

    # sp "That's not why I'm here."
    sp "Non è per questo che sono qui."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:28
translate italian lisa11_698f3156:

    # "She holds out her hand and opens it, revealing a small key."
    "Allunga la mano e la apre, mostrando una piccola chiave."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:29
translate italian lisa11_f971e6b8:

    # sp "I was changing the sheets on my bed, and I pulled the bed out from the wall a little."
    sp "Stavo cambiando le lenzuola del mio letto e ho allontanato un po’ il letto dalla parete."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:30
translate italian lisa11_14a984c4:

    # sp "This key was between the bed and the wall, like it had fallen there and gotten stuck."
    sp "Questa chiave era tra il letto e la parete, come se fosse caduta lì e fosse rimasta incastrata."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:31
translate italian lisa11_07383f08:

    # sp "I have no idea what it might go to. It must have been your father's though."
    sp "Non ho idea di cosa possa aprire. Deve essere stata di tuo padre, però."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:32
translate italian lisa11_29cefead:

    # sp "You've been looking into his things some, right? Do you have any idea what it might unlock?"
    sp "Hai dato un’occhiata alle sue cose, vero? Hai idea di cosa possa aprire?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:33
translate italian lisa11_cb4f15ad:

    # pc "I'm not sure."
    pc "Non ne sono sicura."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:36
translate italian lisa11_bcb67439:

    # sp "Well why don't you take it. You've been looking into his disappearance more than I have, I know. Maybe you can find what it goes to."
    sp "Beh, perché non la prendi? Ti sei occupata della sua scomparsa più di me, lo so. Magari riesci a scoprire a cosa serve."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:37
translate italian lisa11_63023601:

    # pc "Okay."
    pc "Ok."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:38
translate italian lisa11_992dd270:

    # sp "Just let me know if you find anything. Okay, honey?"
    sp "Fammi solo sapere se trovi qualcosa. Ok, tesoro?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:39
translate italian lisa11_01171d90:

    # pc "Okay, [mom]."
    pc "Ok, [mom]."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:40
translate italian lisa11_e80f0a5a:

    # sp "And we'll deal with the other... stuff... some other time."
    sp "E ci occuperemo delle altre... cose... un’altra volta."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:41
translate italian lisa11_dfa9ae3b:

    # sp "I just need a little more time to think about all of this."
    sp "Ho solo bisogno di un po’ più di tempo per riflettere su tutto questo."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:44
translate italian lisa11_981522fd:

    # "With that, she stands up and starts to walk out of the room."
    "Detto questo, si alza e inizia a uscire dalla stanza."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:46
translate italian lisa11_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/lisa_goodnight.wav'
    voice 'voices/lisa_goodnight.wav'

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:47
translate italian lisa11_504e6893:

    # sp "Good night, honey. I love you."
    sp "Buonanotte, tesoro. Ti voglio bene."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:48
translate italian lisa11_93df423a:

    # pc "Love you too, [mom]."
    pc "Ti voglio bene anch’io, [mom]."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:51
translate italian lisa11_1ce407a4:

    # "She walks out and shuts the door."
    "Esce e chiude la porta."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:52
translate italian lisa11_17bdeaa1:

    # "I put the key on the night stand, thinking of places that it might go to."
    "Metto la chiave sul comodino, pensando ai posti in cui potrebbe servire."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:53
translate italian lisa11_6eb1c739:

    # "I'll be sure to look around tomorrow."
    "Domani darò sicuramente un’occhiata in giro."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:72
translate italian lisa11b_45041214:

    # "I walk down into the basement to look around. Maybe there's something down here that the key goes to?"
    "Scendo in cantina per dare un’occhiata. Forse qui sotto c’è qualcosa a cui serve questa chiave?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:75
translate italian lisa11b_0ce52b58:

    # "I'm not really sure where to start though. Was there anything down here that was locked?"
    "Non so bene da dove cominciare, però. C’era qualcosa di chiuso a chiave quaggiù?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:78
translate italian lisa11b_24c55b3a:

    # "Oh wait a minute. The safe. Could this key go to that?"
    "Oh, aspetta un attimo. La cassaforte. Questa chiave potrebbe servire per quella?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:81
translate italian lisa11b_7d9788e7:

    # "I walk over and kneel down in front of the safe. It has a dial on the front, but that seems like it's just for show."
    "Mi avvicino e mi inginocchio davanti alla cassaforte. Ha una rotella sulla parte anteriore, ma sembra che sia solo per bellezza."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:82
translate italian lisa11b_1e8bf5d6:

    # "There is a keyhole directly in the center of the dial, and the key Lisa gave me fits into it perfectly."
    "C’è un buco della serratura proprio al centro della rotella, e la chiave che mi ha dato Lisa ci entra perfettamente."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:83
translate italian lisa11b_968ff7d2:

    # "I turn the key, then pull the handle and open the safe."
    "Giro la chiave, poi tiro la maniglia e apro la cassaforte."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:86
translate italian lisa11b_cd2be96e:

    # pc "Woah."
    pc "Wow."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:87
translate italian lisa11b_f4993b24:

    # "I have no idea how much money that is, but it's a lot."
    "Non ho idea di quanti soldi siano, ma sono tantissimi."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:88
translate italian lisa11b_2b8392cf:

    # "And in front of all of the cash is an envelope that has Lisa's name on it."
    "E davanti a tutto quel denaro c’è una busta con il nome di Lisa scritto sopra."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:89
translate italian lisa11b_f4df4ca9:

    # "Dad must have left all of this for her."
    "Papà deve aver lasciato tutto questo per lei."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:92
translate italian lisa11b_0652396e:

    # "I pick up the envelope. I half-consider opening it and taking a look myself."
    "Prendo la busta. Per un attimo penso di aprirla e dare un’occhiata io stesso."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:93
translate italian lisa11b_2a644210:

    # "I shouldn't though. Better to give it to her. It's probably personal."
    "Ma non dovrei. Meglio darla a lei. Probabilmente è una cosa personale."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:94
translate italian lisa11b_86e4569e:

    # "At least she won't have to worry about bills for a while."
    "Almeno per un po’ non dovrà preoccuparsi delle bollette."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:97
translate italian lisa11b_a6707303:

    # "I close the safe and take the key and the letter with me, then leave the basement."
    "Chiudo la cassaforte e prendo con me la chiave e la lettera, poi esco dal seminterrato."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:104
translate italian lisa11b_74736304:

    # "I should get to school."
    "Dovrei andare a scuola."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:120
translate italian lisa11c_3227967b:

    # "I go to Lisa's room and push the door open slightly. She's lying on her bed, looking away from me."
    "Vado nella stanza di Lisa e spingo leggermente la porta per aprirla. È sdraiata sul letto, con lo sguardo rivolto altrove."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:121
translate italian lisa11c_18e46dc8:

    # pc "Hey [mom], are you sleeping?"
    pc "Ehi [mom], stai dormendo?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:122
translate italian lisa11c_cd4f18c7:

    # sp "No, not sleeping. Just resting."
    sp "No, non sto dormendo. Mi sto solo riposando."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:123
translate italian lisa11c_3dff98b0:

    # "I'm surprised, she doesn't even turn towards me."
    "Sono sorpreso, non si gira nemmeno verso di me."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:124
translate italian lisa11c_76e7237c:

    # sp "Did you need something?"
    sp "Avevi bisogno di qualcosa?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:125
translate italian lisa11c_7b8e5b75:

    # pc "I found what the key went to. It opened a safe in the basement."
    pc "Ho scoperto a cosa servisse la chiave. Apriva una cassaforte nel seminterrato."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:126
translate italian lisa11c_7bd6a230:

    # sp "Oh really? What was in it?"
    sp "Oh, davvero? Cosa c’era dentro?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:127
translate italian lisa11c_5f5da353:

    # pc "Enough money that you're not going to have to worry about things for a while."
    pc "Abbastanza soldi da non doverti preoccupare di nulla per un po’."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:130
translate italian lisa11c_9cc3ee2f:

    # sp "What? Really?"
    sp "Cosa? Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:131
translate italian lisa11c_db707b75:

    # pc "Yeah, there has to be several thousand dollars in there, at least."
    pc "Sì, ci saranno almeno diverse migliaia di dollari lì dentro."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:132
translate italian lisa11c_8430e1a8:

    # pc "And there was this envelope. It's for you."
    pc "E c’era questa busta. È per te."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:135
translate italian lisa11c_5651902f:

    # sp "For me?"
    sp "Per me?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:136
translate italian lisa11c_40f0697c:

    # sp "Your dad left me a note and a bunch of money?"
    sp "Tuo padre mi ha lasciato un biglietto e un sacco di soldi?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:137
translate italian lisa11c_c02b520f:

    # pc "It seems that way."
    pc "Sembra proprio di sì."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:138
translate italian lisa11c_fd67cf4b:

    # sp "Did you open it?"
    sp "L’hai aperta?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:139
translate italian lisa11c_6b7c31f4:

    # pc "No, it was meant for you, not me."
    pc "No, era per te, non per me."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:142
translate italian lisa11c_82c596b9:

    # "She opens up the envelope and pulls out a long, hand-written letter. I recognize my father's almost illegible scrawl immediately."
    "Lei apre la busta ed estrae una lunga lettera scritta a mano. Riconosco immediatamente la grafia quasi illeggibile di mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:143
translate italian lisa11c_8b4394a6:

    # sp "\"Dear Lisa, I'm sorry to leave without telling you anything. I'm afraid you'll try to stop me and I think you would succeed.\""
    sp "\"Cara Lisa, mi dispiace andarmene senza dirti nulla. Temo che cercheresti di fermarmi e penso che ci riusciresti.\""

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:144
translate italian lisa11c_515254e5:

    # sp "\"Or that you would think that I am out of my mind, and lock me in some institution. Maybe that is where I should be.\""
    sp "\"O che penseresti che sono fuori di testa e mi rinchiuderesti in qualche istituto. Forse è proprio lì che dovrei stare.”"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:145
translate italian lisa11c_74cb1071:

    # sp "\"I have built a machine. I am going to use it to find her...\""
    sp " “Ho costruito una macchina. La userò per trovarla...”"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:148
translate italian lisa11c_11f5d677:

    # "Lisa continues reading the note, though her voice trails away as tears begin flowing down her cheeks."
    "Lisa continua a leggere il biglietto, anche se la sua voce si affievolisce mentre le lacrime cominciano a scorrerle lungo le guance."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:149
translate italian lisa11c_8f38bc28:

    # "I put my arm around her, trying to comfort her, not really knowing what to do."
    "La abbraccio, cercando di confortarla, senza sapere bene cosa fare."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:152
translate italian lisa11c_121db800:

    # "When she finishes reading the letter, she crumples it into a ball and throws it across the room, scowling."
    "Quando finisce di leggere la lettera, la accartoccia e la lancia dall’altra parte della stanza, con un’espressione accigliata."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:154
translate italian lisa11c_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/lisa_fuckingbastard.wav'
    voice 'voices/lisa_fuckingbastard.wav'

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:155
translate italian lisa11c_a5382b91:

    # sp "FUCK! Fucking bastard! I can't believe him!"
    sp "CAZZO! Fottuto bastardo! Non riesco a crederci!"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:158
translate italian lisa11c_2aaac290:

    # "She turns and collapses into my arms, squeezing me tight."
    "Si gira e crolla tra le mie braccia, stringendomi forte."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:160
translate italian lisa11c_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/lisa_bastard.wav'
    voice 'voices/lisa_bastard.wav'

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:161
translate italian lisa11c_dd0de08b:

    # sp "Bastard..."
    sp "Bastardo..."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:162
translate italian lisa11c_3865529e:

    # "I just hold her as she sobs into my chest, her tears soaking through my shirt."
    "La stringo a me mentre singhiozza sul mio petto, le sue lacrime mi inzuppano la camicia."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:163
translate italian lisa11c_4ed1e745:

    # "She keeps crying for I don't know how long. Until no more tears are coming out, and her breathing begins to slow down."
    "Continua a piangere per non so quanto tempo. Finché non le escono più lacrime e il suo respiro comincia a rallentare."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:167
translate italian lisa11c_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/lisa_sorry3.wav'
    voice 'voices/lisa_sorry3.wav'

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:168
translate italian lisa11c_89be2b54:

    # sp "I'm sorry."
    sp "Mi dispiace."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:169
translate italian lisa11c_f713d4de:

    # pc "It's okay. Whatever you need, [mom]. I'm here for you."
    pc "Va tutto bene. Qualunque cosa ti serva, [mom]. Sono qui per te."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:170
translate italian lisa11c_8c19424d:

    # sp "Will you stay with me tonight? Just sleep with me. Hold me. Nothing more."
    sp "Rimarrai con me stanotte? Dormi semplicemente con me. Stringimi. Nient’altro."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:171
translate italian lisa11c_bc12ce42:

    # sp "I just don't want to be alone."
    sp "È solo che non voglio stare da sola."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:172
translate italian lisa11c_23aaba02:

    # pc "Sure [mom]. Of course."
    pc "Certo [mom]. Ovviamente."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:175
translate italian lisa11c_12454e17:

    # "I lie with her, holding her."
    "Mi sdraio accanto a lei, stringendola."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:176
translate italian lisa11c_0d3176d3:

    # "When I try to ask her what was in the letter, she starts crying again."
    "Quando provo a chiederle cosa c’era nella lettera, ricomincia a piangere."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:177
translate italian lisa11c_60ee0c75:

    # "Then she falls asleep. Her sobs finally stopping. After a while, I fall asleep too."
    "Poi si addormenta. I suoi singhiozzi finalmente cessano. Dopo un po’, mi addormento anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:180
translate italian lisa11c_1f57e518:

    # "I sleep harder than I expected to. It must be from all the drama. All the worrying about Dad."
    "Dormo più profondamente di quanto mi aspettassi. Dev’essere per via di tutto quel trambusto. Tutte le preoccupazioni per papà."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:181
translate italian lisa11c_fbbfecd8:

    # "And worrying about Lisa too."
    "E anche per Lisa."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:184
translate italian lisa11c_897fedc8:

    # "I must have slept through her getting up in the night, because when I wake up in the morning, she's gone and there's another note on the bed."
    "Devo aver dormito così profondamente da non accorgermi che si è alzata durante la notte, perché quando mi sveglio al mattino, lei non c’è più e sul letto c’è un altro biglietto."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:187
translate italian lisa11c_dbbfa079:

    # "I anxiously pick it up and read it."
    "Lo raccolgo con ansia e lo leggo."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:188
translate italian lisa11c_46f47007:

    # "\"Thank you for last night. You were exactly what I needed right now. I still need time to think about things though.\""
    " “Grazie per ieri sera. Eri esattamente ciò di cui avevo bisogno in questo momento. Ho ancora bisogno di tempo per riflettere, però.\""

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:189
translate italian lisa11c_b7a30203:

    # "\"But I love you. Very much.\""
    "\"Ma ti amo. Moltissimo.\""

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:190
translate italian lisa11c_f2b9cd11:

    # "\"-Lisa\""
    "\"-Lisa\""

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:193
translate italian lisa11c_22b22b07:

    # "Hopefully this is one step closer to making things okay between us again."
    "Spero che questo sia un passo avanti per sistemare di nuovo le cose tra noi."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:3
    old "Wait a few days after the previous scene."
    new "Aspetta qualche giorno dopo la scena precedente."

    # game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa11.rpy:4
    old "Then this scene will happen automatically when you sleep at home."
    new "Poi questa scena accadrà automaticamente quando dormirai a casa."

